  "document": {
    "abstract": "This document updates the changes to the TLS and DTLS IANA registries made in RFC 8447. It adds a new value, \"D\" for discouraged, to the \"Recommended\" column of the selected TLS registries and adds a \"Comment\" column to all active registries that do not already have a \"Comment\" column. Finally, it updates the registration request instructions. This document updates RFC 8447.",
